<main>

<section class="page-hero page-hero--mint" id="overview"><div class="wrap form-shell"><div class="page-hero__copy reveal"><span class="ey">Book a demo</span><h1>Show us the buyer requirement.</h1><p class="lead">Tell us which customer, procurement system and ecommerce store you need to connect. We will help you understand the path.</p><div class="metrics-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin-top:30px"><article class="metric"><strong>90+</strong><span>customers using PunchOut technology built by our team.</span></article><article class="metric"><strong>$50M+</strong><span>in order value processed through our technology every year.</span></article></div></div>
<div class="form-card reveal"><form action="/thank-you/" method="get"><div class="form-grid">
<div class="form-field"><label for="name">Name</label><input id="name" name="name" required></div>
<div class="form-field"><label for="email">Work email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" required></div>
<div class="form-field"><label for="company">Company</label><input id="company" name="company" required></div>
<div class="form-field"><label for="platform">Buyer procurement system</label><select id="platform" name="platform"><option>Not sure yet</option><option>Coupa</option><option>SAP Ariba</option><option>JAGGAER</option><option>Oracle Procurement</option><option>Workday</option><option>Other</option></select></div>
<div class="form-field form-field--full"><label for="message">What did the buyer ask for?</label><textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Example: Our customer uses Coupa and asked if our Shopify store supports PunchOut."></textarea></div>
<div class="form-field form-field--full"><button class="btn pri" type="submit">Book my PunchOut demo →</button></div>
</div></form><p class="form-note">Starter website form. Connect this form to your CRM, calendar or form endpoint before production launch.</p></div></div></section>
</main>
